00:03:52.300 --> 00:03:59.440
This actually was a little bit of a conspiracy
theory that started spreading before the Facebook

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:08.379
post on December 5th claimed Joe Biden killed
the Kelly Lefler staffer.

00:04:08.379 --> 00:04:14.260
And as PolitiFact points out, Harrison Deal,
a campaign staffer for Senator Kelly Lefler,

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:17.409
died after a three vehicle collision.

00:04:17.409 --> 00:04:21.489
A spokesperson for the police department in
the town where it happened said a flatbed

00:04:21.489 --> 00:04:27.860
