00:04:27.860 --> 00:04:30.990
And there is just no evidence that Joe Biden
was involved.

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:39.449
And what's really crazy about these stories
is that the story starts to get some oxygen

00:04:39.449 --> 00:04:44.340
to the point where someone will want to put
out like a fact check.

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:50.409
And then the fact that it gets fact checked
becomes part of the conspiracy.

00:04:50.409 --> 00:04:55.240
Like you and I might read that and say, oh,
OK, it's like in really clear and simple terms,

00:04:55.240 --> 00:05:00.129
there is no actual evidence that there was
foul play here, that Joe Biden killed Kelly

00:05:00.129 --> 00:05:02.219
Lefler staffer, that this was a murder.

00:05:02.219 --> 00:05:03.520
There's just there's just no evidence of it.

00:05:03.520 --> 00:05:09.750
You and I might see it that way, but the believers
will see the fact check as part of the conspiracy.

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:14.669
And this is a really common tenet, or some
people call it a tenant, like when they say

00:05:14.669 --> 00:05:17.419
pundit's God, that pisses me off.

00:05:17.419 --> 00:05:19.629
OK, anyway, it's a tenet.

00:05:19.629 --> 00:05:26.490
And one of the tenets of conspiracy ism is
that once you've generated the conspiracy

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:34.020
theory, evidence for it supports your belief
in it, evidence against it supports your belief

00:05:34.020 --> 00:05:37.659
in it, because obviously the evidence against
it is planted.

00:05:37.659 --> 00:05:41.849
Not finding evidence supports your belief
in it because the evidence must have been

00:05:41.849 --> 00:05:43.490
covered up or hidden.

00:05:43.490 --> 00:05:45.050
And you get into the circle of conspiracies.

00:05:45.050 --> 00:05:47.210
I mean, some people can never get out.

00:05:47.210 --> 00:05:50.270
You know, Trump talks about flushing toilets
10 or 15 times.

00:05:50.270 --> 00:05:52.370
You just you can't flush your way out of this.

00:05:52.370 --> 00:05:56.900
It just stays there and it lingers and it
lingers and there's really no way out of it.

00:05:56.900 --> 00:06:03.270
So there's Sydney Powell, very, very dangerous
woman, a disgusting woman, and someone who

00:06:03.270 --> 00:07:11.909
seems to be dealing with some pretty serious
issues of her own.

